    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DICE &amp; SWORD is a board game base RPG. You can roll the dice and start the story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rolling the dice to move and fight the enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat that you can attack, defend or flee with the Dice!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the enemies to get the items for sell or craft new equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some place can build towers to help you fight enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level-up improves your abilities and unlocks new skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 chapters of story + ???</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ Usable characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ Different enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ Items or equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ different skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All game elements are done by one person. No Assest or AI.</p></li></ul>",
